    /// PDL wave-B seam (gap-diagnosis arc, GAP-DIAGNOSIS.md verdict 8): the gemma
    /// NVFP4mix decode chain's hot kernels — nvfp4 fused2/mr2 and the q8_0 `_rp`
    /// singles — join the wave-A launch class. Scheduling-only (the entry macro waits
    /// on the producer before any read), bit-identical by construction.
    /// MEMRA_PDL_NVFP4=0 reverts wave-B alone.
