    /// wave-2 fold: a + b with the sum emitted q8_1 alongside f32.
    /// Host-len twin of `rms_norm_qkv_rope_append_dc` (zoo-fusion arc): the eager decode
    /// arm tracks kv length on host (`kvl.len`), so the append slot rides the launch arg
    /// instead of the device counter. Kernel body is SHARED with the _dc entry (one
    /// inlined body — bit-identical to the rms_norm_qkv_rope + append pair it replaces,
    /// same law as the dc fold). `n_rot` is the layer's derived rotary width and MUST equal
    /// `head_dim` ([`Engine::full_width_rope_only`]).
